    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "For example, the following code evaluates the polynomial with the coefficients `[10.0, 20.0, 30.0]` and the variables `[7.0, 5.0]`:",
      "ko": "For example, the following code evaluates the polynomial with the coefficients `[10.0, 20.0, 30.0]` and the variables `[7.0, 5.0]`:",
      "sourceHash": "3ac912f07b502d124adb205777d0e16897c70dd54e80854be1a497b433f0af5c",
      "status": "failed"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "```swift\n    let coefficients: [Double] = [10, 20, 30]\n    let variables: [Double] = [7, 5]\n    \n    let result = vDSP.evaluatePolynomial(usingCoefficients: coefficients,\n                                         withVariables: variables)\n    \n    // Prints \"[660.0, 380.0]\".\n    //    result[0] = (10 * 7²) + (20 * 7¹) + (30 * 7⁰) = 660\n    //    result[1] = (10 * 5²) + (20 * 5¹) + (30 * 5⁰) = 380\n    print(result)\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\n    let coefficients: [Double] = [10, 20, 30]\n    let variables: [Double] = [7, 5]\n    \n    let result = vDSP.evaluatePolynomial(usingCoefficients: coefficients,\n                                         withVariables: variables)\n    \n    // Prints \"[660.0, 380.0]\".\n    //    result[0] = (10 * 7²) + (20 * 7¹) + (30 * 7⁰) = 660\n    //    result[1] = (10 * 5²) + (20 * 5¹) + (30 * 5⁰) = 380\n    print(result)\n```",
      "sourceHash": "1ab3835e7370a7d7bb23f4a89d4e8d77e931ff6e90aa0d2744703d40b5a36601",
      "status": "preserved"
